  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 200 C. Cut the sweet potato into 1 cm cubes and the chicken breast into 2 cm pieces.",
   "Season the chicken with salt, pepper and paprika. Put the chicken and the sweet potato on two trays with no oil.",
   "Roast the sweet potato for 25 minutes and the chicken for 15 to 18 minutes, until the chicken is cooked through.",
   "Cook the frozen peas in boiling water for 2 minutes, drain and let them cool.",
   "Mix the yogurt with the mustard and a pinch of salt and pepper. This is the honey mustard style dressing; the apple adds the sweetness.",
   "Dice the apple and open the pomegranate to take out the seeds. Roughly chop the walnuts and crumble the feta.",
   "Prep day: keep chicken, sweet potato, peas, apple, pomegranate, walnuts, feta and dressing in separate boxes for each serving.",
   "To eat: mix everything in a bowl and add the dressing. Reheat the chicken and sweet potato in the microwave first if you want, then add the cold items and dressing."
